3.0 ()
================
- moved the classes for sites without Slim to the Standalone namespace
- updated Controller for RavenSpa and JSON responses
- added Input, RouteUrl and Http
- added Config::fromEnv() for .env and environment settings
- added SessionMiddleware, AuthMiddleware and SecurityHeadersMiddleware
- added session cookie options (SameSite=Lax by default)
- added JSON errors to SlimErrorController and CsrfMiddleware
- improved CspMiddleware's default policy
- improved uploaded svg files: remote references are removed
- added unit tests
- upgraded enshrined/svg-sanitize to 1.0 (security fixes)
- upgraded PHPUnit to 12
- fixed Database not storing emoji (utf8mb4)
- fixed bugs in Database, Disk, Web, Config, Request, Form, Code, Random and HostRestrictionMiddleware
- fixed PHP 8.4 and 8.5 deprecation warnings

2.2 (2026-03-09)
================
- upgraded enshrined/svg-sanitize to version 0.22

2.1 (2025-09-14)
================
- added controllers
- added middleware
- added functions and web methods
- added View
- added Config
- updated Session

2.0 (2024-11-20)
================
- reformatted namespaces
- added resources
- added dependency injection class
- code improvements and cleanup